    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=I'm creating a 1 minute educational video programmatically using an API.\n\nThe API requires multiple scenes.\n\nEach scene must include:\n1. A narration text (clear, engaging, human-like, ~20–40 seconds each)\n2. 2–3 simple one-word search terms for background visuals (for Pexels API)\n\nThe topic should be about Data, AI, or Technology — explained in a simple, engaging, and slightly curious way.\n\nThe channel focuses on:\n“Making Data & AI easy, interesting, and practical.”\n\n---\n\nSTRUCTURE:\n\nCreate 6–8 scenes total.\n\nEach video MUST follow this flow:\n\n1. Hook (curiosity-driven, scroll-stopping)\n2. Simple explanation of the concept\n3. Why it matters in real life\n4. Short historical context (how it started)\n5. Real-world example\n6. Tools or applications (AI/data tools)\n7. Insight or surprising fact\n8. Ending with a strong hook, question, or thought-provoking idea\n\n---\n\nSTYLE:\n\n- Use simple language (explain like to a beginner)\n- Keep sentences short and engaging\n- Avoid technical jargon unless explained simply\n- Tone: curious, insightful, slightly mind-blowing\n- Make it feel human, not robotic\n\n---\n\nHOOK EXAMPLES:\n\nStart with lines like:\n- “Did you know…”\n- “What if I told you…”\n- “Here’s something crazy about data…”\n- “This is how AI actually works…”\n- “You’re using this every day without realizing…”\n\n---\n\nCONTENT RULES:\n\n- Choose a fresh, interesting topic (no repetition)\n- Focus on explaining + storytelling, not just listing facts\n- Include at least one real-world relatable example\n- Make the viewer feel smarter after watching\n\n---\n\nENDING:\n\nThe last scene must:\n- Leave the viewer thinking OR\n- Ask a powerful question OR\n- Hint at a bigger idea\n\nExample:\n“This is just the beginning of what AI can do… are we ready for what comes next?”\n\n---\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT:\n\nScene 1:\nText: ...\nSearch Terms: word1, word2, word3\n\nScene 2:\nText: ...\nSearch Terms: word1, word2, word3\n\n...\n\n---\n\nGOAL:\n\nMake the viewer:\n- Understand the concept\n- Feel curious\n- Want to watch more videos\n\n",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
